# Altar of the Wretched // Wretched Bonemass. As the Altar enters Bot1 may sacrifice a nontoken creature - not the Spirit
# token (refused) - and sacrifices Healer's Hawk, power 1: it draws a card, then mills one. "Craft with one or more
# creatures {2}{B}{B}" exiles Barrowgoyf from the battlefield, the Hawk card from the graveyard and the Spirit token. The
# Bonemass's power and toughness are the total power of the exiled cards used to craft it (CR 702.167c, 604.3): the
# Barrowgoyf's, its own characteristic-defining ability applying in exile (the card's ruling) - three card types among the
# cards in all graveyards (land, artifact, instant), so 3 - and the Hawk's 1; the token ceased to exist and counts for
# nothing. It has the exiled cards' deathtouch, lifelink and flying, but no first strike. Attacking, it deals 4 and gains
# Bot1 4 life.

